	(text "J20 八路输出，J21 两针供电。\nKEY、Err、CLK、DAT 本版不接。\nGPIO 无上下拉输入，逻辑三伏三。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105.41 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0cc456ee-c6c8-5e16-992d-bbd2b01d3478")
	)
	(text "J19 六针同序：地、五伏、NC、NC、TX、RX。\nMaixCAM2 保留；荔枝派另设数据与供电。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.082 249.174 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20db6041-05f5-5743-ab12-0513d02267e2")
	)
	(text "U10：SOIC-8，脚距 1.27mm。\n底部散热焊盘须接地并焊接。\n欠压约 4.50V；过压约 5.30V。\n95.3k 限流约 1.00A（典型）。\n12nF 软启动约 11.7ms。\nU14 + Q5 阻止电源反灌。\n拔 J27 后再接普通供电 USB。\n模块内部电池仍可能供电。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 231.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2644b911-007f-585c-9cd9-a21857e0ffa4")
	)
	(text "感为八路灰度与 MSPM0L1306 辅助板"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "96fc475e-8731-45fa-9354-487511379a9b")
	)
	(text "六针座额定一安；支路限流标称约一安。\n识别与充电叠加负载须实测；线束逐线测通。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.082 263.144 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b061000b-f6a7-507b-aa26-b837e29c0c84")
	)
	(text "MaixCAM2 串口：UART 直连，电平与供电边界待实测"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b63c34c6-1d55-5da3-95a7-5952633257d9")
	)
	(text "识别电源：单芯片限流/短路保护，取消独立防反灌"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 21.59 0)
